# Unity text assets
*.unity text
*.prefab text
*.asset text
*.mat text
*.anim text
*.controller text
*.overrideController text
*.meta text

# Unity YAML files generated by the editor
*.unity linguist-generated
*.prefab linguist-generated
*.asset linguist-generated
*.mat linguist-generated
*.anim linguist-generated
*.controller linguist-generated
